Isolated showers. 

.SUNDAY...East winds 10 to 15 knots, becoming 7 to 10 knots. Seas

5 to 7 feet. Isolated showers through the night, then scattered

showers through the day. 

.MONDAY...East winds 10 to 15 knots. Seas 4 to 6 feet. Isolated

