........................KEY........................

SKY/WX - SKY CONDITION/WEATHER

TMP    - TEMPERATURE IN FAHRENHEIT

DP     - DEW POINT IN FAHRENHEIT

RH     - RELATIVE HUMIDITY IN PERCENT

WIND   - DIRECTION AND SPEED IN MILES PER HOUR (MPH)

VRB    - VARIABLE WIND DIRECTION

PRES   - MEAN SEA LEVEL PRESSURE IN INCHES OF MERCURY

         F - FALLING PRESSURE   R - RISING PRESSURE

         S - STEADY PRESSURE

VSB    - VISIBILITY IN MILES

HX     - HEAT INDEX IN FAHRENHEIT

WCI    - WIND CHILL INDEX IN FAHRENHEIT

TC     - TEMPERATURE IN CELSIUS WHICH IS ALSO KNOWN AS

         TEMPERATURE IN CENTIGRADE

AFB    - AIR FORCE BASE

         LUKE AFB IS LUKE AIR FORCE BASE

         DAVIS-MONTHAN IS DAVIS-MONTHAN AIR FORCE BASE

NAS    - NAVAL AIR STATION

         EL CENTRO NAS IS EL CENTRO NAVAL AIR STATION

N/A    - NOT AVAILABLE



